() Tj T*
(4 TECHNICAL SPECIFICATION — CONCRETE AND REINFORCEMENT) Tj T*
(\(a\) Plain and reinforced cement concrete works shall comply with IS 456:2000.) Tj T*
(\(b\) Grade of concrete for all RCC members shall be M30.) Tj T*
(\(c\) The nominal cover to reinforcement shall be 45 millimetre.) Tj T*
(\(d\) Maximum free water-cement ratio shall be 0.45.) Tj T*
(\(e\) Cement content shall be not less than 320 kg per cubic metre.) Tj T*
(\(f\) OPC 43 grade cement complying with IS 269:2015 shall be used.) Tj T*
(\(g\) Aggregates, both coarse and fine, shall comply with IS 383:2016. Fe 500D TMT) Tj T*
(reinforcement bars complying with IS 1786:2008 shall be used.) Tj T*
(\(h\) Mix proportioning of concrete shall be done as per IS 10262:2019.) Tj T*
(\(i\) Concrete shall be cured for not less than 10 days.) Tj T*
(\(j\) Mechanical needle vibrators shall be used for compaction of concrete.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(PART E — STRUCTURAL STEEL WORK) Tj T*
(\(a\) Structural steel plates and sections shall be E250 grade complying with IS) Tj T*
(2062:2011.) Tj T*
(\(b\) Steel work shall be painted with one coat of zinc chromate primer followed by two) Tj T*
(finishing coats of enamel.) Tj T*
(\(c\) Steel work shall be fabricated and erected in accordance with approved drawings.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(PART F — INTERNAL WIRING AND EARTHING) Tj T*
(\(a\) All wiring work shall comply with IS 732:2019.) Tj T*
(\(b\) The earthing arrangement of the supply system is TN-S.) Tj T*
(\(c\) All wiring shall run concealed in rigid PVC conduit having 1.5 millimetre wall) Tj T*
(thickness.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Signature of Bidder) Tj T*
