(\(e\) MCBs shall comply with IS/IEC 60898-1 and have a rated short-circuit capacity of 10) Tj T*
(kA rms.) Tj T*
(\(f\) MCBs from 6 ampere up to 32 ampere shall be provided as per the single line diagram.) Tj T*
(\(g\) All socket outlet circuits shall be protected by 30 mA RCCBs complying with IS 12640) Tj T*
(\(Part 1\).) Tj T*
(\(h\) The earthing installation shall comply with IS 3043:2018. The main distribution) Tj T*
(board shall be earthed through two pipe earth electrodes.) Tj T*
(\(i\) Resistance of the earthing system shall be not more than 1 Ohms.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(7 TESTS AND INSPECTION) Tj T*
(\(a\) Testing of concrete for compressive strength shall be done as per IS 516 \(Part 1/Sec) Tj T*
(1\):2021.) Tj T*
(\(b\) The contractor shall furnish manufacturer's test certificates for every lot of) Tj T*
(cement and reinforcement.) Tj T*
(\(c\) The contractor shall submit mill test certificates for all structural steel) Tj T*
(supplied.) Tj T*
(\(d\) Testing of wires shall be done as per IS 10810.) Tj T*
(\(e\) After completion, the insulation resistance and earth continuity of the installation) Tj T*
(shall be tested as per IS 732.) Tj T*
(\(f\) All wires, MCBs and RCCBs supplied shall carry the ISI mark.) Tj T*
(\(g\) Before despatch, the Engineer-in-charge will inspect the equipment at the maker's) Tj T*
(works.) Tj T*
